        <body>
            <div xml:id="d573">

                <pb facs="1699" n="1524" xml:id="pg1524"/>

                <head>573. Memorandum from Bromley Smith to
                    members of the NSC Executive Committee,
                    December 6, covering an FBI report on Mikoyan’s briefing of the Soviet delegation in
                    New York<anchor n="1" xml:id="d573-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1962-12-06">December 6, 1962</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <pb facs="d573-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d573-1"/>
                <p>Secretary Rusk referred to the attached
                    report during yesterday’s Executive Committee meeting and asked that it be
                    circulated to Committee members. Mr. Hoover has requested that the existence of
                    this report be closely held.</p>
                <closer><signed corresp="#p_SB_1">Bromley
                            Smith</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d573-a1.xml" xpointer="d573-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
